repository-code: "https://github.com/USER_OR_ORG/BABAPPA"
abstract: "BABAPPA is a research-alpha, simulation-trained, conservative branch-site inference support framework with explicit simulator truth validation, Apple Silicon/MPS support, deployable model packaging, empirical input QC, OOD gating, and guarded empirical pilot tooling. Empirical discovery claims remain pending external reference comparison and simulation-matched calibration."
